    46  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
    47  *>                         cols wide and MORE than 27 lines deep and this is to
    48  *>                         allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
    49  *>                         be used as areas for the warning or error messages
    50  *>                         to be displayed. 28 lines is the minimum.
    51  *>                         This procedure must be applied at all times when
    52  *>                         running Payroll.
    53  *>                         For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
    54  *>                         by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
