  1155  *>*******************************************
  1156  *>                                          *
  1157  *>  Record Definition For The System File   *
  1158  *>                                          *
  1159  *>*******************************************
  1160  *>  File size 1024 with fillers
  1161  *>   Cleared down update details 01/02/09 to 12/06/13
  1162  *>
  1163  *> 22/09/15 vbc - Added Param-Restrict (Access) within a current filler.
  1164  *>                Set this will stop display of option Z in sub-system menus.
  1165  *>                Need to detect actual user though when setup or could just use
  1166  *>                chown for sys002 to admin user?
  1167  *> 25/06/16 vbc - Added RDBMS-Port & needs RDBMS-Host, RDBMS-Socket.
  1168  *>                Increased 'System-data' from 384 to 512 bytes & removed O/E
  1169  *>                  Block (128) as it is unused.
  1170  *> 26/06/16 vbc - Updated MySQL Load scripts ACASDB.sql in ACAS/mysql.
  1171  *>                  Prima is yet to be done !!!
  1172  *> 19/10/16 vbc - Changed PL-Approp-AC in IRS block from 9(5) to 9(6) for GL
  1173  *>                support & reduced filler by 1.
  1174  *>                With IRS data mapped into ACAS the IRS block can reduce to 32 bytes
  1175  *>                Just need to change all of the IRS programs to use ACAS fields but
  1176  *>                also NEED to change the date processing to use same in rest of ACAS
  1177  *>                and not binary days since 01/01/2000 and hold dates in dd/mm/yy form.
  1178  *>                Added 2 88s to Op-System for IRS.
  1179  *> 27/10/16 vbc - Changed level-5 to IRS instead of omitted O/E.
