ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PYPEREND    27/03/2026  19:27:43:55                               Page   39

  2053  *>
  2054  *>C      copy "FileStat-Msgs-2.cpy" replacing MSG  by WS-Eval-Msg
  2055  *>C                                         STATUS by PY-PR1-Status.
  2056  *> ***************************************************************
  2057  *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
  2058  *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
  2059  *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
  2060  *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
  2061  *> **                                                           **
  2062  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  2063  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  2064  *> **                                                           **
  2065  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  2066  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  2067  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  2068  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  2069  *>                                                              **
  2070  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2071  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  2072  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  2073  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  2074  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  2075  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  2076  *> ***************************************************************
  2077  *>
  2078   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  2079   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2080   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2081   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2082   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2083   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2084   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2085   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2086   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2087   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2088   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2089   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2090   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2091   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2092   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2093   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2094   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2095   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2096   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2097   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2098   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2099   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2100   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2101   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2102   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2103   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2104   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2105   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2106   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PYPEREND    27/03/2026  19:27:43:55                               Page   40

  2107   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2108   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2109   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2110   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2111   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2112   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  2113            WHEN OTHER
  2114   MOVE "Unknown File PY-PR1-Status      " TO WS-
  2115  *>
  2116       END-EVALUATE.
  2117
  2118  *>>W Msg29 Caution: One or more replacing sources not found
  2119       exit     section.
